    "按顺序念 6 句，每句约 5–10 秒。前 3 句在安静环境，后 3 句请换到不同的日常环境（例如窗边或室外），正常音量说话。旧声纹保留至六句全部录完。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read 6 phrases in order, about 5–10 seconds each. Record the first 3 somewhere quiet, then move to another everyday setting, such as near a window or outdoors. Speak at your normal volume. Your previous voiceprint stays until all six are complete."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按顺序念 6 句，每句约 5–10 秒。前 3 句在安静环境，后 3 句请换到不同的日常环境（例如窗边或室外），正常音量说话。旧声纹保留至六句全部录完。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
