    "请在安静和另一处日常环境各试几句。每句分别显示 WeSpeaker 与 CAM++ 对本机声纹的得分；两模型的分数不能直接互比。目前只使用 WeSpeaker 决定是否自动填入。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try several phrases somewhere quiet and in another everyday setting. Each phrase shows WeSpeaker and CAM++ scores against your local voiceprint. Their scores are not directly comparable. Only WeSpeaker currently decides whether to insert text automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在安静和另一处日常环境各试几句。每句分别显示 WeSpeaker 与 CAM++ 对本机声纹的得分；两模型的分数不能直接互比。目前只使用 WeSpeaker 决定是否自动填入。"
