    "建议单句说话约 1–10 秒；本页有效语音满 1 秒即可打分。开启声纹过滤后，1–2 秒照常由 WeSpeaker 判定，少于 1 秒保留文字供手动确认。本页只保留本次查看的分数，退出即清空，不上传声音或向量。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speak for about 1–10 seconds per phrase; this page can score at least 1 second of detected speech. With voiceprint filtering enabled, WeSpeaker checks 1–2 seconds normally; shorter speech is held for manual confirmation. Scores are kept only for this visit and cleared when you leave. Audio and vectors are not uploaded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建议单句说话约 1–10 秒；本页有效语音满 1 秒即可打分。开启声纹过滤后，1–2 秒照常由 WeSpeaker 判定，少于 1 秒保留文字供手动确认。本页只保留本次查看的分数，退出即清空，不上传声音或向量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
