    "识别时会参考这些词，适合常说的英文术语、产品名和人名。越靠前越优先；录音越长，能带上的词越少。清空即不使用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These terms guide recognition, especially recurring English terms, product names, and names. Earlier lines take priority. Longer recordings allow fewer terms. Clear the list to stop using it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "识别时会参考这些词，适合常说的英文术语、产品名和人名。越靠前越优先；录音越长，能带上的词越少。清空即不使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
