          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录音在这台 iPhone 上转写。锁屏后会继续录音；转写在一呼打开时进行。交给工作台时分享转写文字，不包含录音文件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings are transcribed on this iPhone. Recording continues while locked; transcription runs while Yihu is open. Handing a note to your workbench shares the transcript, not the audio file."
          }
        },
