    "一呼（Yihu）将 iPhone 与 Apple Watch 变成 OpenClaw、Hermes、Dot / Dot Live 与 Collie 的原生移动工作台：端侧 Qwen3 0.6B 离线语音直填草稿、锁屏长语音闪念、灵动岛进度追踪与多项目决策简报。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yihu turns your iPhone and Apple Watch into a native mobile workbench for OpenClaw, Hermes, Dot / Dot Live, and Collie—with on-device Qwen3 0.6B offline voice-to-draft, lock-screen voice notes, Dynamic Island live progress, and multi-project decision briefings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一呼（Yihu）将 iPhone 与 Apple Watch 变成 OpenClaw、Hermes、Dot / Dot Live 与 Collie 的原生移动工作台：端侧 Qwen3 0.6B 离线语音直填草稿、锁屏长语音闪念、灵动岛进度追踪与多项目决策简报。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
