    "当 Hermes 执行终端命令、网页搜索或修改文件时，锁屏与灵动岛会实时显示当前工具与计时。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While Hermes runs terminal commands, web searches, or file edits, Lock Screen and Dynamic Island display the active tool and elapsed timer."
